# UI styling

`lang`/`dir` on **root layout only**. **Logical Tailwind** (`me`/`ms`, `start`/`end`, …).

**shadcn** in `@workspace/ui` (`packages/ui`) — **never hand-edit**; regen via `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add … -c packages/ui`. App behavior in `src/app/**` or `src/components/` (outside package UI).

**Defaults first** — use components with their built-in styles; `className` only when that call site truly needs customization (not to repeat radius, padding, etc. the primitive already provides).

Reuse UI up the tree; hoist to highest relevant scope — [architecture.md § Placement](docs/agents/architecture.md#placement).

**Detail (Read):** [docs/agents/ui-design.md](docs/agents/ui-design.md).
